          "merged_at": "2020-01-04T15:57:15Z"
        },
        "body": "Hello,\r\n\r\nWe were experiencing problems with the Collada importer when dealing with files that had more than one single-channel animation. The problem was that Assimp was combining all single-channel animations, without checking if the channel was the same.\r\n\r\nThis PR adds a check to properly avoid combining the single-channel animations when they are animating the same channel. When they are animating different channels, they are still being combined as expected.",
